  "body": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Before he meets your wali, we meet our standards</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f8f5f0;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;\">\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#f8f5f0;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:40px 20px;\">\n      <table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;\">\n\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"background-color:#003527;padding:32px 40px;text-align:center;\">\n            <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:30px;color:#e9c176;letter-spacing:3px;font-weight:normal;\">Date Khaas</p>\n            <p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:#e9c176;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:0.75;\">Muslim Matrimony</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Hero image -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0;line-height:0;\">\n            <img src=\"https://datekhaas.com/assets/email/hero-nikah.jpg\" alt=\"A serene Muslim wedding\" width=\"600\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;display:block;height:280px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Opening warmth -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:52px 48px 32px;text-align:center;\">\n            <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:13px;color:#e9c176;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:normal;\">For the heart that is ready</h1>\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 28px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:34px;line-height:1.25;color:#003527;font-weight:normal;\">There is a calm that comes<br>with knowing.</h2>\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#444444;\">That the person you are about to meet is exactly who they say they are. That your photos will only be seen by someone who has earned that trust. That your family is part of the process — not a formality added at the end.</p>\n            <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#444444;\">The Messenger of Allah ﷺ described the marriage bond as a <span style=\"font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;color:#003527;font-style:italic;\">mithāqan ghalīẓan</span> — a solemn, weighty covenant. At Date Khaas, we believe the path to your nikah should carry that same reverence.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Divider -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 48px;\">\n            <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n              <tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #e9c176;\"></td></tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Trust pillars -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:36px 48px 0;\">\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 24px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:20px;color:#003527;text-align:center;font-weight:normal;\">How we protect your journey</p>\n\n            <!-- Pillar 1 -->\n            <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"background-color:#f8f5f0;border-left:3px solid #e9c176;padding:20px 24px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:18px;color:#003527;font-weight:normal;\">Every profile, verified before you ever see it.</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#666666;line-height:1.65;\">We review each profile individually before it goes live. No batch approvals. No shortcuts. If we are not satisfied, you never meet them.</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n\n            <!-- Pillar 2 -->\n            <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"background-color:#f8f5f0;border-left:3px solid #e9c176;padding:20px 24px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:18px;color:#003527;font-weight:normal;\">Your photos, blurred by default. Shared on your terms.</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#666666;line-height:1.65;\">Your privacy is the baseline, not a premium tier. You decide who sees your face, and when. On Date Khaas, photo control is a right, not a reward.</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n\n            <!-- Pillar 3 -->\n            <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"background-color:#f8f5f0;border-left:3px solid #e9c176;padding:20px 24px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:18px;color:#003527;font-weight:normal;\">Your wali, invited from the first conversation.</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#666666;line-height:1.65;\">Invite your father, brother, or trusted guardian to follow conversations from day one. This is how it should be — family as a foundation, not a formality.</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- CTA block -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:44px 48px 52px;text-align:center;\">\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 28px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#444444;\">You are looking for someone who will be your sukoon — your peace. We are building the platform worthy of that search.</p>\n            <a href=\"https://datekhaas.com/join\" style=\"display:inline-block;background-color:#003527;color:#e9c176;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;padding:18px 44px;\">Begin Your Journey</a>\n            <p style=\"margin:20px 0 0;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#999999;\">Free to join. Verified from the start.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Footer -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"background-color:#003527;padding:28px 40px;text-align:center;\">\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:15px;color:#e9c176;font-weight:normal;\">Date Khaas</p>\n            <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#ffffff;opacity:0.6;line-height:1.7;\">You received this because you expressed interest in Date Khaas.<br><a href=\"https://datekhaas.com/unsubscribe\" style=\"color:#e9c176;text-decoration:none;\">Unsubscribe</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"https://datekhaas.com/privacy\" style=\"color:#e9c176;text-decoration:none;\">Privacy Policy</a></p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
